      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "趁她移开视线，我立刻从桌子里\n取出用来提神的超辣零食，\n塞进嘴里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "386533592dc412e2f52b536a4656facbf472bbfecc0f2074e755a32713710bb2",
